        <schema:exclusion xml:lang="en">Eating</schema:exclusion>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Taking hold of a drink, bringing it to the mouth, and consuming the drink in culturally acceptable ways, mixing, stirring and pouring liquids for drinking, opening bottles and cans, drinking through a straw or drinking running water such as from a tap or a spring; feeding or suckling from the breast.</skos:definition>
